    "markdown": "# Materials {#sec-materials}\n\nMaterials are items of type *material* (Q5). Works link to them with the property *Material* (P10). Where available, materials are connected to Wikidata (P24) or the Art & Architecture Thesaurus (P26).\n\n\n\nThe CPS Wikibase describes **33** materials, of which **33** are used by at least one work.\n\n::: {#cell-fig-materials .cell execution_count=2}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=2}\n![The most frequently used materials.](materials_files/figure-html/fig-materials-output-1.png){#fig-materials}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n::: {#tbl-materials .cell tbl-cap='Materials, number of works and external identifiers.' execution_count=3}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=3}\n```{=html}\n<table class=\"dataframe\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n      <th>ID</th>\n      <th>Material</th>\n      <th>Works</th>\n      <th>Wikidata</th>\n      <th>AAT</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q11</td>\n      <td>acrylic paint</td>\n      <td>24</td>\n      <td>Q207849</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q10</td>\n      <td>canvas</td>\n      <td>21</td>\n      <td>Q4259259</td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q198</td>\n      <td>sound</td>\n      <td>16</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q18</td>\n      <td>black-and-white photograph</td>\n      <td>15</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q197</td>\n      <td>color</td>\n      <td>15</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q199</td>\n      <td>black-and-white</td>\n      <td>12</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q22</td>\n      <td>color photograph</td>\n      <td>11</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Q41</td>\n      <td>hand lettering</td>\n      <td>11</td>\n      <td></td>\n      <td></td>\n    </tr